    "- `Batch Normalization and feed-forward after input layer`\n",
    "- `1 GraphSAGE layer` with `mean pooling`\n",
    "- `Batch Normalization`\n",
    "- `Dropout: 0.2`\n",
    "- `Feed-forward network with 2 linear layers`"
